WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.760
It’s your big show! Plan a story, build it with everything you know, and share it with the class.

2
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:10.260
Draw your story: beginning, middle, end.

3
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.120
Use at least two pages.

4
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:16.760
Moves, talking, grow and shrink, hide and show, hop and repeat.

5
00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:22.950
Show your animated story to the class and tell them about it.

6
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:30.410
Dragon: say “I’m tiny!”, grow 2 times, fly up 2 to the cloud (star), hop 2 times with 🔁, then say “The end!”.

7
00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:31.420
A whole animated story in one script!

8
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:36.930
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

9
00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.190
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
